  "subject": "a Tai Hang local who runs beside the 67-metre fire dragon on Mid-Autumn night with a bag of joss sticks, pulling out the burnt-down ones and pushing in fresh ones through the smoke",
  "caption": "Cantonese stoner rock with a slow desert-rock groove. Down-tuned fuzz guitar riffs through a cranked valve amp, a thick distorted bass doubling the riff, slow pounding drums with big floor toms, and a Chinese lion-dance drum, gong and hand cymbals hitting with the riff in the processional sections. Smoky, saturated live-room recording, amps humming between riffs, percussion mixed up front. A low gravelly male baritone, unhurried and chant-like, a crew shouting the answer lines. 76 BPM, D minor. Heavy, smoky, proud and hypnotic. No metal growls, no blast beats, no autotune, no pop-ballad chorus, no EDM.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n中秋夜 浣紗街\n六十七米 一條草龍\n七萬枝香 插滿佢成身\n煙大到 隔籬嘅人都睇唔清\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n鑼鼓一響 龍頭抬起\n我揹住一袋香 跟住佢條尾\n\n[Chorus]\n換香 換香\n燒剩半截 拔走插返枝新\n眼濕濕 係煙焗 唔係喊\n換香 換香 唔好畀條龍熄\n\n[Verse]\n細路騎喺老竇膊頭\n遊客舉高部電話\n條龍轉個身 掃過我頭頂\n啲香灰 跌落我件白背心\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n一百幾年前 呢度有瘟疫\n老人家話 就係咁舞 先舞走佢\n\n[Chorus]\n換香 換香\n條龍轉得幾快 我都照插\n眼濕濕 係煙焗 唔係喊\n換香 換香 唔好畀條龍熄\n\n[Bridge]\n第三晚 我哋送佢落海\n拍走成身香灰 等明年\n\n[Chorus]\n換香 換香\n大坑成條街 成晚都係香\n眼濕濕 係煙焗 唔係喊\n換香 換香 明年中秋再嚟\n\n[Outro]\n龍走咗 我件背心仲有陣香",
